OL,3,GNEWSAOld youth centre to be demolished
OL,4,Ain #3.5m scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former youth centre will be
OL,7,Fdemolished and a new one built in its
OL,8,Fplace as part of a multi-million pound
OL,9,Fproject.
OL,11,FThe East Centre in Prudhoe,
OL,12,FNorthumberland, is to be knocked down
OL,13,Fso a new youth centre can be built
OL,14,Falongside retail and business units and
OL,15,Fthree residential properties.
OL,17,FThe #3.5m project has been developed by
OL,18,FPrudhoe Community Partnership and
OL,19,FNorthumberland County Council for the
OL,20,Flast 10 years.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
