OL,3,GNEWSAOld youth centre to be demolished
OL,4,Ain #3.5m scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour councillor for Prudhoe West with
OL,7,FMickley, Angie Scott, welcomed the
OL,8,Fplans but said because progress had
OL,9,Fbeen "painfully slow" there was now a
OL,10,F"shortfall in funding".
